 longer had that um many cabinet  ministers spoke to him or spoke to his  team or spoke to the chief whip to say  uh you know that the time is up he's  going to have to  resign and i'm pleased that's what he  did you know he reflected on that advice  that he had from cabinet ministers and  chose to step down on his own terms when  will we know who the next prime minister  is  um it will probably  uh be i would imagine sometime in  september  um the 1922 committee and the  conservative party will obviously need  to announce the the rules but they'll be  the parliamentary rounds over the next  two weeks so we'll be down to probably  just two candidates by the end of next  week and then those two candidates will  go out on a series of hustings around  the country during august possibly early  september as well i would imagine at  some time  you know middle of september perhaps  we'll have a new leader in place yeah  after they've ripped lumps out of each  other let's see what happens it's good  to talk to you well it's very important  that people you know we're all  colleagues and we're going to have to  pull back together and work together  very important people people work  sensibly okay for now thanks very much  indeed thank you

